  "body": "Hi,\r\n\r\nafter an initial installation via the debian repository, synapse cannot start. The error is: \r\n\r\n> Missing mandatory `server_name` config option.\r\n\r\nI have installed synapse via ansible, there is no way for an interactive install process like the installation documents recommend, so there was no way to add a value for `server_name` during installation.\r\nI fixed it with manually adding this key and a value to homeserver.yaml, but maybe you could add a default value, wich then will be overwritten by the interactive installation process or via dpkg-reconfigure. ",
